    "body": "In step 22 and 24 there are a lot of \"browsing context\" strings that maybe could be _browsingContext_; it is hard for me to be sure.\n\nSimilarly, steps 16 onward have a lot of un-italicized \"resource\", and it seems like some of them definitely could be _resource_.\n\nHappy to trust your judgment since a lot of these are ambiguous, given the nature of the algorithm. But wanted to point them out to see what you thought.\n",
